{"id":"en_ranch-girl-true-heiress","title":"Ranch Girl？True Heiress！","titleEn":"Ranch Girl？True Heiress！","description":"Laura arrives at Mercer Manor as the concealed true heiress, a country girl subjected to the cruelty of Evelyn, the scheming fake daughter, and Sebastian, her arrogant fiancé. At a gala, Sebastian publicly humiliates her by breaking off their engagement. Laura then reveals a secret that changes everything: her rough-hewn adoptive father controls the port’s transport and energy supply, on which the Mercer family depends. With the balance of power now in her hands, she rejects every groveling apology and brings down the privileged elites who once mistreated her. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/ranch-girltrue-heiress/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/ranch-girltrue-heiress/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Heiress Swap","Modern","Tit for Tat","Woman","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dhk80/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_ranch-girl-true-heiress_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dhk80/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ranch-girl-true-heiress_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dhk80/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ranch-girl-true-heiress_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dhk80/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_ranch-girl-true-heiress_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id